<title>USA: Universal Forest cash sufficient for reinvestment.</title>
<headline>Universal Forest cash sufficient for reinvestment.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Forest Products Inc said it anticipates having sufficient cash for reinvestment and acquisitions.</p>
<p>Earlier, Universal Forest declared a semi-annual cash dividend of $0.03 a share.</p>
<p>&quot;Even with the dividend, we anticipate having sufficient cash available for continued reinvestment in the company and to make strategic acquisitions,&quot; Peter Secchia, chairman, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Universal Forest makes wood products for the do-it-yourself retail and manufactured housing markets.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
